\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2   In interviews, Western influencers who were featured in Chinese media said they had not set out with the goal of disproving any narrative. They had merely wanted to experience for themselves a country they had heard so much about in daily headlines.}
